Hi people,

I am happy to share the news about our 4th CodeFest, a techie/geek's 
camp. About 30-40 guys had a great time in Seoul for 48 hours this 
weekend. Some of the guys did not sleep at all because they were busy 
coding!

Here are the pictures I took
http://gallery.kldp.org/codefest4

I organized this event from the beginning and pics from previous
event are also in http://gallery.kldp.org

I hope more country support this kind of camp for techies. It really
helps people to collaborate better and build a good community in a shorter 
time as well as a bunch of actual code which would have required longer 
time without this kind of face-to-face meeting.

All you need is a dedicated internet connection with PCs for those
without laptops.

Regards,
--
http://kldp.org/~kss

