YES Linux Release Team would like to announce the immediate availability
of YES Linux 2.1 Final.  This release of YES Linux features over 30
changes from Builds 0, 1, and 2.  Some of the most significant changes are
the ability to manage website virtual hosts from the administration
application, ability to have statistics for all websites including virtual
hosts and email server from the administration application, ability to
purchase domain names from either the introduction or from the
administration application, ability to modify the internal firewall from
the administration application, and the introduction of a dynamic message
bus to yes configuration.

YES Linux can be downloaded from http://www.yeslinux.org/iso/ , on
BitTorrent Network http://www.tlm-project.org/torrents/yeslinux or one of
our mirrors http://www.yeslinux.org/iso/mirrors.html

A list of installed applications will be available from the support site
under YES Linux http://www.yeslinux.org/forum/viewtopic.php?t=328.

----

The major changes for Build 2 are:

addition:
firewalladmin - allows modifications from the web admin application
yes-firewall - configuration files for firewalladmin
yes-dns - added ability to purchase domain names from the admin application

removal:

updates:
zip - from fedoralegacy
yes-website - added website stats to the build script
yes-admin - added new stats admin interface, firewall admin, purchasing of
domain names
yes-stats - added website virtual hosts and mail server support and new
admin interface
yes-security - updated for website virtual hosts stats
yes-intro - updated for website virtual hosts stats

Sincerely,
YES Linux Release Team

